{"unit_id":"guoPhineas__dsh-weather-sky#feature-2","repo":"guoPhineas/dsh-weather-sky","commit":"129d67c013d6677975d2fcac2070608ee7e31daf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Weather & Sky 的功能「昼夜天空动画」：插件根据天气和昼夜绘制太阳或月亮、月相与星星，并按条件叠加云层、雨雪、雾和雷暴闪电。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:313-375","src/client/index.ts:389-415"]}
{"unit_id":"guoPhineas__dsh-weather-sky#feature-3","repo":"guoPhineas/dsh-weather-sky","commit":"129d67c013d6677975d2fcac2070608ee7e31daf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Weather & Sky 的功能「定时更新天气」：插件启动后立即刷新，并每 15 秒重新定位和请求天气；请求暂时失败时保留上一帧，卸载时清理定时器和界面。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:434-477"]}
{"unit_id":"guoPhineas__dsh-weather-sky#caveat-1","repo":"guoPhineas/dsh-weather-sky","commit":"129d67c013d6677975d2fcac2070608ee7e31daf","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Weather & Sky 会在浏览器定位不可用时向 ipwho.is 请求 IP 位置，并把坐标发送到 api.open-meteo.com 获取天气；浏览器定位需用户环境允许。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:183-210"]}
